Patch summary:
Android 17's fewer activity restarts on configuration changes (9dd80009749,
4909d835bd1, 5efa43fb82f), without its flag and change ID: keyboard, keyboard
hidden, navigation, touchscreen and color mode changes no longer recreate an
activity by default (the app gets onConfigurationChanged), unless its manifest
asks for it in recreateOnConfigChanges or the package has resources qualified
for that configuration. Ika's console attaches its virtual gamepad while its
window has focus, which used to restart games that did not declare those
changes. Adds the hidden Resources#getResourceConfigurations().

